 "reading_text": "Notes Fixture Deck\nA small deck with speaker notes, bullets and a table\nWelcome. This deck exists so a parser can be checked for speaker notes; read this note aloud only in a test.\nWhat This Deck Covers\nThree kinds of slide content\na title with a subtitle\na bulleted list with two levels\na four column table\nSpeaker notes on every content slide\nnotes are not on the slide canvas\nSecond slide notes: the two-level bullets are the thing to check, and the notes should not be mixed into them.\nStations by Line\nStation\nLine\nOpened\nPlatforms\nHarbor Point\nBlue\n1912\n2\nMill Street\nBlue\n1925\n4\nOrchard Hill\nGreen\n1958\n2\nThird slide notes: the table has one header row and three data rows; Orchard Hill opened in 1958.\nClosing Slide Without Notes",
